# Program 2 · P2-R016A — audit integration tests run against an ISOLATED test database, NEVER the
# development database. jest globalSetup provisions & resets it automatically (see test/global-setup.ts),
# and createTestPrisma() FAILS CLOSED unless the connected database is an approved "*test*" database on a
# local host.
#
# By default the helper derives "<dev-db>_test" from DATABASE_URL / DATABASE_MIGRATION_URL (in .env),
# so no configuration is required locally. Override explicitly only if your isolated database differs:
#
# TEST_DATABASE_URL="postgresql://cytolab_api:PASSWORD@localhost:5432/cytolab_test"
# TEST_DATABASE_MIGRATION_URL="postgresql://cytolab_migrate:PASSWORD@localhost:5432/cytolab_test"
#
# In CI, set these to the CI test database. They must point at a database whose name contains "test"
# and a local/permitted host, or the audit integration tests abort (fail-closed).
